url: "https://github.com/lucasmella-stack/PAMPAr-o1"
license: "AGPL-3.0-or-later"
date-released: "2026-01-20"
abstract: >
  PampaR is a brain-inspired language model with territorial architecture. 
  It uses 4 specialized territories (Expressive, Contextual, Formal, Structural) 
  coordinated by a Thalamus that routes tokens using hybrid rules (LLAVES 70%) 
  + learned attention (30%). Achieves perplexity ~45 with only 14M parameters 
  on WikiText-103, outperforming LSTM (24M, PPL 69.1) and Transformer-XL Small 
  (24M, PPL 54.5) with 42% fewer parameters. Trained entirely on consumer 
  hardware (GTX 1650 4GB VRAM).
keywords:
